<header><p class="enc-kicker">State</p><h1 class="enc-title">Göktürk Khaganate</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Göktürk Empire, Göktürks, Gokturk Empire, Göktürk, Gokturk</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Göktürk Khaganate was a Turkic empire founded by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ashina-clan">Ashina clan</a> in 552, which came to dominate the Eurasian steppe from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/manchuria">Manchuria</a> to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/black-sea">Black Sea</a>. It allied with the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/sasanian-empire">Sasanian Empire</a> to destroy the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hephthalites">Hephthalites</a> and later split into eastern and western khaganates. It inherited and transformed the steppe traditions of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/xiongnu-empire">Xiongnu</a>.</p></div>
